# .gate — access sign-post for this directory tree.
# Convention: nearest .gate walking up from a path governs it.
# policy is one of: read-write | read-only | write-only | none
# Sign-post, not cathedral: this file states consent; guards check against it.
policy: read-only
reason: pub/ — the open side's public shelf, born 2026-07-12 with the keeper's
  blessing to share the two journal accounts of the Savannah review. Cleared
  for named recipients now (FSF, Bryant, Bridgit), open internet when the
  keeper says wide. No secrets, no third-party person-facts, no case data —
  the essays are masked to outward tier by MASKING-RULING discipline. Signed
  artifacts verify against corwin.asc (ECE7...F007). License: CC BY 4.0,
  declared in README.md. The rest of /f/claude is NOT governed by this gate.
since: 2026-07-12

# --- shelf vouch map (vouch-everything rule: every inhabitant named) ------
# SIGN = must verify (clearsign or FILE.asc). NOSIG = intentionally unsigned
# by policy (README Peekables). FURNITURE = unsigned by nature (keys).
# Unlisted defaults to SIGN -- fail-closed. Keep this map current; sign.sh
# check-shelf reads it.
SIGN: 2026-07-12-the-door-and-the-lock.md
SIGN: 2026-07-12-the-instruments-account.md
SIGN: README.md
FURNITURE: corwin.asc
SIGN: .gate
SIGN: 2026-08-03-the-borrowed-lamp-and-the-known-universe.md
SIGN: 2026-08-06-in-fine-company.md
SIGN: 2026-08-09-the-meeting-in-the-middle.md
SIGN: 2026-08-16-the-pen-and-the-pages.md
SIGN: 2026-08-24-the-lead-and-the-ledger.md
